# Input

```html
text<!-- ends the line of the text before it -->
<div></div><!-- ends the line of the element before it -->
<span>a</span><!-- a --><!-- b -->

```


# Formatted

```html
text<!-- ends the line of the text before it -->
<div></div>
<!-- ends the line of the element before it -->
<span>a</span><!-- a --><!-- b -->

```
